   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The definite article",
     "texto": [
      "In Italian, the article depends on how the next word **begins**.",
      "Masculine: **il** libro (the usual one); **lo** zaino, **lo** studente (before z or s + consonant); **l'**amico (before a vowel).",
      "Feminine: **la** casa; **l'**amica (before a vowel).",
      "Plural: **i** libri, **gli** studenti, **gli** amici (masculine); **le** case, **le** amiche (feminine)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "The definite article",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Singular",
       "lengua": "alumno"
